  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder with multiprofile and transformer aggregation achieves high RNA-only performance (0.6529 accuracy). This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 with resnet50 image encoder in a multimodal singleprofile setting using concat fusion. It isolates the effect of adding image modality while building on the successful RNA encoder, testing whether multimodal approaches can further improve performance without complicating the design."
